#summary Lantern 0.4.5: dependency updates and no vault prompt in development builds
#describe what Releases Lantern 0.4.5: version 0.4.5 and its changelog section.
#describe before 0.4.4 was the latest release, and every development build asked for the macOS password to open the credential vault.
#describe after 0.4.5 carries the dependency updates, and development builds skip the vault unless LANTERN_DEV_VAULT=1.
#describe verified Typecheck, lint and the full test suite (446 files) green.
~ CHANGELOG.md
~ package.json
#order package.json
#order CHANGELOG.md
#reason CHANGELOG.md Gives users the 0.4.5 notes and the compare links, as earlier releases did
#reason package.json The release tag v0.4.5 must match the version the packaged app reports
#story A maintainer ships Lantern 0.4.5
#step actor Maintainer
#step action merges this and tags
#file package.json
#step subject the 0.4.5 release
#file CHANGELOG.md
#below actor Lantern user
#below interaction can read what 0.4.5 changed and fixed
#below consequence 0.4.4 is the latest release => 0.4.5 is the latest release
